ware-group-qilin/\">Who Runs the Ransomware Group Qilin?</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.mdr.de/nachrichten/thueringen/ost-thueringen/greiz/krankenhaus-notaufnahme-,greiz-hackerangriff-100.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">Emergency room in Greiz reopened after hacker attack</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/16/infoblox-customer-and-staff-data-exposed-in-sharepoint-breach/5310280\">Infoblox customer and staff data exposed in Sharepoint breach</a>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/technology/equinor-detects-ongoing-cyberattack-output-unaffected-2026-11-17/\">Norway’s Equinor detects ongoing cyberattack, oil and gas output unaffected</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/usao-cdca/pr/british-national-sentenced-6-years-federal-prison-hacking-companies-and-stealing-least\">British National Sentenced to 6 Years in Federal Prison for Hacking into Companies and Stealing at Least $11 Million in Virtual Currency</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/legal/government/us-judge-clears-mit-educated-brothers-25-million-cryptocurrency-heist-charges-2026-11-16/\">US judge clears MIT-educated brothers of $25 million cryptocurrency heist charges</a>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://therecord.media/ukraine-ransomware-arrests-cyber\">Ukraine exposes ransomware network extorting US oil, healthcare firms</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://hunt.io/blog/us-bank-irs-ssa-logins-stolen-russian-speaking-operator\">US bank and federal logins stolen off victims’ own PCs by a Russian-speaking operation</a></p><p><a href=\"https://krebsonsecurity.com/2026/11/attackers-used-optimizely-to-a-b-test-malware-on-top-websites/\">Attackers Used Optimizely to A/B Test Malware on Top Websites</a></p><p><a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/chase-data-leak-cyberattack-8470d475450721b66858bdace47091c0\">A cyberattack leaks thousands of Chase customer emails and some phone numbers</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a