lnerabilities in danfoss sm-800A</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://censys.com/blog/artex-agentic-asbestos/\">ARTEX: Agentic Asbestos</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/technology/equinor-detects-cyberattack-against-some-it-systems-2026-11-17/\">Equinor detects cyberattack against some IT systems</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://calif.io/java4shell\">Java4Shell Write once, RCE everywhere</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/critical-apache-roller-rce-flaw-under.html\">Critical Apache Roller RCE Flaw Under Active Exploitation, No Authentication Required</a></p><p><a href=\"https://nginx2root.com/\">NGINX2Root From nginx visitor to root of the server host</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.iverify.com/blog/the-rise-and-rise-of-darksword-attacks\">The Rise and Rise of DarkSword attacks</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/php-warns-of-critical-security-flaws.html\">PHP Warns of Critical Security Flaws Affecting All Supported Versions, Fixes Coming November 19</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/MSNightmare/FastUnlock\">FastUnlock FastUnlock : Windows Narrator LockScreen Bypass 0day Vulnerability</a>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://f6.security/media-center/press-releases/cisco-vulnerability-exploitation/\">F6 Investigates First Exploitation of Critical CVE-2026-76466 Vulnerability in Cisco Expressway</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.securityweek.com/whatsapp-fixes-flaw-uncovered-while-disrupting-scam-campaign/\">WhatsApp Fixes Flaw Uncovered While Disrupting Scam Campaign</a>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/cairn-framework-ai-autonomous-attacks/\">Attackers Use Autonomous AI to Target Semiconductor, Defense and Civil Society Sectors</a></p><p><strong>Intelligence and Information Warfare</strong> &nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://ics-cert.kaspersky.com/publications/reports/2026/11/05/supply-chain-attack-bo-team-in-a-software-developers-infrastructure